@startuml
[*] --> Waiting for Data Entry
Waiting for Data Entry --> Data Being Entered : Data entry starts
Data Being Entered --> Validating Data : Data submitted
Validating Data --> Applying Corrections/Enhancements : Validation passes
Applying Corrections/Enhancements --> Data Saved : Corrections applied
Data Saved --> [*] : Data saved
Validating Data --> Prompting for Correction : Validation fails
Prompting for Correction --> Validating Data : Corrections made
@enduml
